################ distilbert ################
Sudowoodo CPU feasibility check
  lm=distilbert ssl_method=combined batch_size=64 max_len=128 threads=4
  cuda available: False (expected False)

  model load: 1s (counted as per-config startup)

  Measured per-step cost, per dataset (seq = mean padded sequence length):

    task   train     ssl step    ft step    
    --------------------------------------------
    CDDB   2508      18.81s seq52 5.58s seq74
    CORA   142714    38.57s seq113 13.05s seq128
    D2     20014     48.35s seq128 14.28s seq128
    D3     8124      44.44s seq128 16.69s seq128
    D4     1376      38.35s seq107 11.50s seq127
    D5     95194     14.28s seq49 6.12s seq78
    D6     193460    9.20s seq34 3.93s seq55
    D7     4686      41.14s seq128 14.09s seq128
    D8     26050     27.66s seq87 13.54s seq128
    D9     7548      31.24s seq102 10.56s seq125

  Projected wall time per config. Lower bound -- excludes
  --bootstrap and --clustering, which add an encode pass each.

    task   (3,50)      (3,10)      (2,5)       (1,3)       (1,1)      
    ------------------------------------------------------------------
    CDDB   8.9h      ! 3.4h      ! 2.1h      ! 66m         50m        
    CORA   817.2h    ! 128.7h    ! 57.1h     ! 37.1h     ! 2.7h      !
    D2     144.6h    ! 28.0h     ! 13.8h     ! 8.4h      ! 2.5h      !
    D3     71.7h     ! 16.1h     ! 8.5h      ! 4.9h      ! 2.1h      !
    D4     12.6h     ! 6.2h      ! 3.9h      ! 2.0h      ! 1.7h      !
    D5     286.0h    ! 46.5h     ! 21.1h     ! 13.5h     ! 1.5h      !
    D6     377.4h    ! 60.6h     ! 27.2h     ! 17.6h     ! 1.7h      !
    D7     37.3h     ! 10.4h     ! 5.8h      ! 3.2h      ! 1.9h      !
    D8     170.5h    ! 29.6h     ! 13.9h     ! 8.7h      ! 1.7h      !
    D9     44.1h     ! 10.4h     ! 5.5h      ! 3.2h      ! 1.5h      !

    '!' = over the 1.5h cap. Those become TIMEOUT rows, which is a
    reportable result -- but a dataset that is '!' in EVERY column
    cannot be searched at all under the frozen protocol, and that
    needs raising with the supervisor.

    (3,50) is the authors' published setting.

